  "reasoning": "The defendant, 罗1某, used his relationship with a senior land‑resource official to obtain a construction project and a mining licence, receiving large sums of money in return (300万 and 250万, plus 200万 consulting fees that were effectively bribes). These acts constitute the crime of accepting bribes (受贿). He also paid 100万 to officials to secure the project, which is the crime of giving bribes (行贿). Additionally, he gave 35万 on behalf of the macro‑company to a public official, which is the crime of unit bribery (单位行贿). Therefore three charges apply: 受贿, 行贿, and 单位行贿.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]受贿;行贿;单位行贿<eoa>"
}

